{"name":"Picture-frame panelling on one wall of the living room, Haringey (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (10 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (nothing measured): one wall of the room, 4200 long, 2900 to the ceiling, with the door at one end and a radiator at the other. Pine moulding 20 wide and 12 proud, mitred at the corners: three tall frames above a 70 mm dado rail at 880 to 950 (the last one over the radiator), a short frame over the door, and two shorter frames below the dado where there is no radiator, all with 100 mm gaps (the same gap to the architrave). Wall, door, architrave, skirting, cornice and radiator are room context. The other walls of the room are panelled the same way and are not drawn. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X along the wall, Y out from the room, Z up.","materials":{"Wall":{"color":[236,234,228],"roughness":0.95},"Room: pine door":{"color":[196,150,96],"roughness":0.7},"Room: white woodwork":{"color":[246,245,240],"roughness":0.6},"Room: radiator":{"color":[244,244,242],"roughness":0.4},"Pine moulding":{"color":[224,192,134],"roughness":0.7}},"view":{"yaw":-0.3,"pitch":0.15,"yawMin":-1.1,"yawMax":1.1,"pitchMin":0.0,"pitchMax":1.0},"apart":["Frames above the dado","Frames below the dado","Dado rail"],"geoms":{"g0":{"v":[-150,0,0,-150,150,0,150,150,0,150,0,0,-150,0,2900,150,0,2900,150,150,2900,-150,150,2900],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]],[[4,5,6,7]],[[0,3,5,4]],[[3,2,6,5]],[[2,1,7,6]],[[1,0,4,7]]],"e":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,0],[4,5],[5,6],[6,7],[7,4],[3,5],[4,0],[2,6],[1,7]]},"g1":{"v":[150,0,2100,150,150,2100,1000,150,2100,1000,0,2100,150,0,2900,1000,0,2900,1000,150,2900,150,150,2900],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]],[[4,5,6,7]],[[0,3,5,4]],[[3,2,6,5]],[[2,1,7,6]],[[1,0,4,7]]],"e":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,0],[4,5],[5,6],[6,7],[7,4],[3,5],[4,0],[2,6],[1,7]]},"g2":{"v":[1000,0,0,1000,150,0,4200,150,0,4200,0,0,1000,0,2900,4200,0,2900,4200,150,2900,1000,150,2900],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]],[[4,5,6,7]],[[